-Sessions never expire.
+## Session expiry
+
+`save_session` records an `issued_at` timestamp (Unix seconds). `load_session` rejects a
+session older than `SESSION_TTL` (3600 seconds, defined in `sessionsvc.store`) with
+`SessionExpiredError`, as well as one with a missing or invalid `issued_at`.
+
+`purge_expired()` deletes expired entries from the on-disk cache and is called on every
+restore.
+
+Resume blobs are base64-encoded JSON, not pickle.
